rnnoise-go
==========

A pure-Go port of RNNoise (https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/rnnoise, mirrored at
https://github.com/xiph/rnnoise), ported from upstream commit 70f1d256.

The algorithm, the neural network topology and the trained weights are the work
of Jean-Marc Valin and contributors. Portions derive from Opus/CELT (KISS FFT,
the pitch analysis and the LPC helpers), originally by Mark Borgerding,
Jean-Marc Valin and the Xiph.Org Foundation.

